==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Big Sal]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Axoloty|Axoloties]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use meatshields to activate the Axoloties' attack, then use [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]] stacking to [[Freeze|freeze]] the Big Sal and you can add [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]] as an attacker. If you have him, use [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Prof. Cat Jobs]] when Big Sal is on your base for less RNG.

After Big Sal is dead, you can now rush down the rest of the stage. Use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|tankers]] ([[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]] works, too) to defeat Dark Emperor Nyandam and knockback the Axoloties. An easy way to deal with the Big Sal is by using [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Paragon Cat]], who can infinitely stall it, as long as no other enemy comes in their range. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Mohawk Cat]] is very useful in this stage due to their wave immunity and meatshield status.

